properties.statement:
Build the settled shape:
- /jot is one skill, and /log-issue (tags ISSUE) and /note (tags IDEA) are shortcuts into it, in COMMAND_ALIASES;
- loop_status follow_ups show each note's tag;
- settling routes by the tag;
- /log-issue keeps working exactly as today.
Then cut a release (minor: a new skill). Then flo2 regenerates engine-skills.ts from it, and the droplet moves to that version, which also picks up 0.69.0's get_skill change.
